<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Dashboard administrator PUSDATIN UMKOE">
    <title>Dashboard Admin | PUSDATIN UMKOE</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../css/admin/admin-layout.css">
</head>
<body data-admin-protected>
    <div class="admin-layout">
        <aside class="admin-sidebar">
            <a href="../../index.html" class="sidebar-brand">
                <span class="brand-icon">P</span>
                <span>
                    <strong>PUSDATIN</strong>
                    <small>ADMINISTRATION</small>
                </span>
            </a>

            <div class="sidebar-label">MENU UTAMA</div>

            <nav class="sidebar-nav">
                <a href="dashboard.html" class="sidebar-link active">
                    <span>▦</span> Dashboard
                </a>

                <a href="../admin-pdm.html" class="sidebar-link">
                    <span>▤</span> Manajemen PDM
                </a>
            </nav>

            <div class="sidebar-bottom">
                <a href="../../index.html" class="sidebar-link">
                    <span>↗</span> Lihat Website
                </a>

                <button type="button" id="logoutButton" class="logout-button">
                    <span>⇥</span> Keluar
                </button>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <main class="admin-content">
            <header class="admin-topbar">
                <div>
                    <span class="topbar-caption">ADMINISTRATION</span>
                    <h1>Dashboard</h1>
                </div>

                <div class="admin-profile">
                    <span class="profile-avatar">A</span>
                    <span>
                        <strong>Administrator</strong>
                        <small>Admin PUSDATIN</small>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </header>

            <section class="welcome-panel">
                <div>
                    <span class="welcome-label">PUSDATIN UMKOE</span>
                    <h2>Selamat datang di Panel Admin</h2>
                    <p>
                        Kelola informasi dan layanan digital Universitas
                        Muhammadiyah Kupang melalui halaman administrasi ini.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="welcome-symbol">P</div>
            </section>

            <section class="dashboard-section">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div>
                        <span class="section-caption">RINGKASAN PDM</span>
                        <h2>Statistik Pengajuan</h2>
                        <p>Ringkasan data pengajuan PDM yang tersimpan di browser ini.</p>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" id="refreshDashboard" class="dashboard-refresh">
                        ↻ Perbarui Data
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="stats-grid">
                    <article class="stat-card stat-total">
                        <span class="stat-icon">▤</span>
                        <div>
                            <p>Total Pengajuan</p>
                            <strong id="dashboardTotal">0</strong>
                            <small>Seluruh pengajuan</small>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="stat-card stat-waiting">
                        <span class="stat-icon">◷</span>
                        <div>
                            <p>Menunggu Pemeriksaan</p>
                            <strong id="dashboardWaiting">0</strong>
                            <small>Belum diperiksa</small>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="stat-card stat-revision">
                        <span class="stat-icon">↻</span>
                        <div>
                            <p>Perlu Perbaikan</p>
                            <strong id="dashboardRevision">0</strong>
                            <small>Menunggu revisi mahasiswa</small>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="stat-card stat-approved">
                        <span class="stat-icon">✓</span>
                        <div>
                            <p>Disetujui</p>
                            <strong id="dashboardApproved">0</strong>
                            <small>Pengajuan disetujui</small>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="dashboard-section">
                <div class="section-heading recent-heading">
                    <div>
                        <span class="section-caption">AKTIVITAS TERBARU</span>
                        <h2>Pengajuan PDM Terbaru</h2>
                        <p>Lima pengajuan terakhir berdasarkan waktu pengiriman.</p>
                    </div>

                    <a href="../admin-pdm.html" class="dashboard-view-all">
                        Lihat Semua →
                    </a>
                </div>

                <div class="recent-table-card">
                    <div class="recent-table-scroll">
                        <table class="recent-table">
                            <thead>
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Mahasiswa</th>
                                    <th>Kode Pengajuan</th>
                                    <th>Tanggal</th>
                                    <th>Metode</th>
                                    <th>Status</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="recentSubmissionBody">
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="5" class="dashboard-empty">
                                        Memuat data pengajuan...
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <div class="recent-table-footer" id="recentTableInfo">
                        Memuat data...
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="dashboard-section">
                <div class="section-heading">
                    <div>
                        <span class="section-caption">AKSES CEPAT</span>
                        <h2>Pengelolaan Layanan</h2>
                        <p>Pilih layanan yang ingin Anda kelola.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="quick-grid">
                    <a href="../admin-pdm.html" class="quick-card">
                        <span class="quick-icon blue">▤</span>
                        <strong>Manajemen PDM</strong>
                        <p>Periksa pengajuan dan perbarui status PDM mahasiswa.</p>
                        <span class="quick-action">Buka pengelolaan →</span>
                    </a>

                    <article class="quick-card disabled-card">
                        <span class="quick-icon yellow">▧</span>
                        <strong>Informasi Website</strong>
                        <p>Pengelolaan konten website akan dikembangkan pada tahap berikutnya.</p>
                        <span class="quick-action">Belum tersedia</span>
                    </article>

                    <article class="quick-card disabled-card">
                        <span class="quick-icon green">⌘</span>
                        <strong>Layanan Infrastruktur</strong>
                        <p>Pengelolaan informasi infrastruktur dan fasilitas kampus.</p>
                        <span class="quick-action">Belum tersedia</span>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>

            <div class="demo-notice">
                <strong>Mode demonstrasi:</strong>
                Login dan sesi masih menggunakan localStorage pada browser ini.
                Belum menggunakan autentikasi maupun database server.
            </div>

            <footer class="admin-footer">
                © 2026 PUSDATIN Universitas Muhammadiyah Kupang
            </footer>
        </main>
    </div>

    <script src="../../js/admin/auth.js"></script>
    <script src="../../js/admin/dashboard.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
